@host = http://localhost:5080

### Daily summaries for a valid symbol
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stocks/TSLA/daily-summaries
Accept: application/json

### Unknown symbol -> 404 problem details
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stocks/NOTAREAL123/daily-summaries
Accept: application/json

### Malformed symbol -> 400 validation problem details
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stocks/BAD%24%24/daily-summaries
Accept: application/json

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health/live

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
